{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>NullWake</strong> is not just a horror game \u2014 it is a true test of your nerves.<br>You wake up in an abandoned hospital where everything seems real, yet with every step the line between reality and nightmare begins to fade. The story pulls you deeper into a world of mystery: a ghost town, parallel universes, and enemies you cannot predict.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd39 <strong>A powerful storyline</strong> \u2014 a narrative that keeps you engaged and makes you question every choice.<br>\ud83d\udd39 <strong>High-quality graphics</strong> \u2014 detailed environments that create a dark and realistic atmosphere.<br>\ud83d\udd39 <strong>Unpredictable jump scares</strong> \u2014 moments of pure terror that strike when you least expect them.<br>\ud83d\udd39 <strong>Heart-stopping atmosphere</strong> \u2014 fear does not only come from the scares, but from the silence, tension, and suffocating dread.<br>\ud83d\udd39 <strong>Challenging puzzles and quests</strong> \u2014 every step forward requires thought, exploration, and solving complex tasks that test both your logic and your courage.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong><i>What awaits you:</i></strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Exploration of haunting locations: a hospital, a ghost town, forests, and abandoned houses.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A heavy, oppressive atmosphere that never lets you feel safe.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enemies that appear where you least expect them.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complex quests and puzzles hidden within the environment.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Psychological pressure that pushes you to the edge of panic.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>NullWake</strong> is a game where true horror hides in the atmosphere itself.<br>Are you ready to feel your heartbeat slow down?</h2>","background":"https://store.